# Copy Style

- Do not use em dashes (`—`) in body text, changelog entries, docs, or other user-facing copy.
- Use a colon, comma, period, or rephrase instead. Example: `**Live Visitors**: count in the menu bar`, not `**Live Visitors** — count in the menu bar`.
- En dashes for numeric ranges are fine (`2024–2026`). Arrow glyphs for UI paths are fine (`Settings → Exclusions`).
